open NumberField IsDedekindDomain MvPolynomial Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.L2.DIV Formalism.DivisionValues GlobalTheory.TestLat Formalism.L2.Indef.Tree.ArchimedeanLeafBounds.Cuts
